{
  "components": [
    {
      "refdes": "V1",
      "kind": "VSource",
      "value": "12",
      "pos": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "rot": 0,
      "footprint": "PinHeader_1x2_PM",
      "custom": null
    },
    {
      "refdes": "U1",
      "kind": "Custom",
      "value": "AMS1117-5.0",
      "pos": [
        30,
        0
      ],
      "rot": 0,
      "footprint": "SOT-223",
      "custom": {
        "name": "AMS1117-5.0",
        "prefix": "U",
        "pins": [
          {
            "number": "3",
            "name": "IN",
            "side": "left"
          },
          {
            "number": "2",
            "name": "OUT",
            "side": "right"
          },
          {
            "number": "1",
            "name": "GND",
            "side": "bottom"
          }
        ],
        "sim": {
          "kind": "subckt",
          "element": "",
          "name": "AMS1117-5.0",
          "text": ".subckt AMS1117-5.0 in gnd out\n* line regulation through a slow path (the data sheet's DC figure) and the ripple from the input (flat, the ripple rejection)\nElf lfa gnd in gnd 1\nRlf lfa lf 1.59Meg\nClf lf gnd 100n\n* output noise (taken as flat over the data sheet's band): a 1 k resistor's noise, scaled\nRnz nz gnd 1k\n* the output's difference from part to part (0 V; the variation analyses move it between the data sheet's min and max)\nVtol vt gnd DC 0\n* spread Vtol -0.075 0.075 vout (data sheet: 4.925 to 5.075 V)\nBtgt t0 gnd V=5+-0.000350488*(V(lf,gnd)-6.5)+0.000398107*(V(in,gnd)-6.5)+V(vt,gnd)\nEn tgt t0 nz gnd 368.611\n* the ceiling the input leaves (the dropout)\nBdo ind gnd V=V(in,gnd)-1.1-0*I(Vs)\n* the target, no higher than the dropout's ceiling\nEx1 xh1 gnd tgt ind 1000\nD1 xh1 yh1 DREG\nRy1 yh1 gnd 1k\nEy1 y1 gnd yh1 gnd 0.001\nEc1 c1 gnd tgt y1 1\n* the current limit: the current the target asks for (amps as volts), no more than the limit\nBu u gnd V=(V(c1,gnd)-V(out,gnd))/0.00625\nBlim cl gnd V=limit(1.1+0*(V(in,gnd)-V(out,gnd)-1.5),1.1,1.1)\nEx2 xh2 gnd u cl 1000\nD2 xh2 yh2 DREG\nRy2 yh2 gnd 1k\nEy2 y2 gnd yh2 gnd 0.001\nEc2 uc gnd u y2 1\nBc2 c2 gnd V=V(out,gnd)+0.00625*V(uc,gnd)\n* output through the load regulation's resistance; the output current comes from the input (both ways, as the earlier\n* bundled models did: a dead or reversed input then leaves the output near 0 V)\nEo o gnd c2 gnd 1\nVs o os DC 0\nRo os out 0.00625\nBin in gnd I=I(Vs)\n* ground (quiescent) current: flat above a few volts, like a resistor near 0 V\nBq in gnd I=0.005*tanh(V(in,gnd)/2)\n.model DREG D(IS=1e-12 N=1)\n.ends AMS1117-5.0",
          "pins": [
            "3",
            "1",
            "2"
          ],
          "params": {
            "dropout": 1.1,
            "vout": 5.0
          },
          "limits": [
            "出力電圧、ドロップアウト (入力が低いと出力が下がる)、出力抵抗、負荷電流が入力電流になることを再現するマクロモデルです。",
            "扱わないもの: リップル除去、負荷や入力が急に変わったときの応答、静止電流、過電流保護、熱による制限。",
            "モデルには内部の応答がないので、入力・出力のコンデンサを付けたときの安定性 (発振しないか) は確かめられません。データシートの推奨回路に従ってください。"
          ]
        },
        "ratings": {
          "v_max": 15.0,
          "i_max": 1.0,
          "rows": [
            {
              "name": "出力電圧",
              "value": "5V ±1%"
            },
            {
              "name": "ドロップアウト電圧",
              "value": "1.1V (代表)",
              "condition": "IO = 800mA"
            }
          ]
        },
        "glyph": "regulator",
        "shops": {
          "lcsc": "C6187"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "refdes": "R1",
      "kind": "Resistor",
      "value": "40",
      "pos": [
        50,
        0
      ],
      "rot": 1,
      "footprint": "R_2512",
      "custom": null
    },
    {
      "refdes": "V2",
      "kind": "VSource",
      "value": "12",
      "pos": [
        0,
        40
      ],
      "rot": 0,
      "footprint": "PinHeader_1x2_PM",
      "custom": null
    },
    {
      "refdes": "U2",
      "kind": "Custom",
      "value": "BUCK_DEMO",
      "pos": [
        30,
        40
      ],
      "rot": 0,
      "footprint": "TO-220-4_inline",
      "custom": {
        "name": "BUCK_DEMO",
        "prefix": "U",
        "pins": [
          {
            "number": "1",
            "name": "VIN",
            "side": "left"
          },
          {
            "number": "2",
            "name": "GND",
            "side": "bottom"
          },
          {
            "number": "3",
            "name": "SW",
            "side": "right"
          },
          {
            "number": "4",
            "name": "FB",
            "side": "right"
          }
        ],
        "sim": {
          "kind": "subckt",
          "element": "",
          "name": "BUCK_DEMO",
          "text": "* Simplified step-down (buck) regulator IC: 150 kHz PWM, internal high-side switch, soft-start, 1.23 V reference. Every voltage is taken against the gnd pin, so the output may be wired as the system ground (the IC sits on a floating negative rail).\n.subckt BUCK_DEMO vin gnd sw fb\nRq vin gnd 4k\nVclk ramp gnd PULSE(0 1 0 6.5u 0.1u 10n 6.67u)\nBgm gnd comp I=limit(0.32m*12/max(V(vin,gnd),3)*(1.23-V(fb,gnd)),-250u,250u)\nCcomp comp gnd 1u\nRcomp comp gnd 1G\nBzero comp gnd I=if(time<1u,1000*V(comp,gnd),0)\nBctl ctl gnd V=limit(V(comp,gnd),0,0.95)\nBpwm pwm gnd V=0.5*(1+tanh(30*(V(ctl,gnd)-V(ramp,gnd)-0.03)))\nS1 vin sw pwm gnd SWMAIN\n.model SWMAIN SW(RON=0.15 ROFF=1MEG VT=0.5 VW=0.15)\n.ends BUCK_DEMO",
          "pins": [
            "1",
            "2",
            "3",
            "4"
          ],
          "params": {
            "fsw_khz": 150.0,
            "vref": 1.23
          },
          "limits": [
            "150kHz で実際にスイッチを入り切りする動作モデルです。デューティ比、コイルのリップル電流、出力のリップル、スイッチの導通損失 (0.15Ω)、ダイオードの損失が、波形と電流に出ます。誤差アンプは積分型で、ゆっくり出力を合わせます (ソフトスタートも兼ねる)。",
            "扱わないもの: 過電流・短絡の保護、過熱保護、スイッチの切替時間と切替損失、軽負荷での間欠動作、入力側のリップル電流、制御ループの細かい補償 (負荷が急に変わったときの応答は、実物より遅く、行き過ぎも少ない)。数値は一般的な降圧ICの概算です。",
            "制御回路の消費電流は、VIN と GND の間の 4kΩ の抵抗で表しています (12V で約 3mA)。",
            "時間刻みは 0.1µs (100n) 程度にしてください。粗いと、スイッチの切り替わりの位置がずれて、出力電圧の平均がずれます。計算に時間がかかるので、見る時間は 5〜10ms 程度から始めましょう。",
            "コイルとダイオードを付け忘れると、出力が出ません。ダイオードは SW から GND へ、カソードを SW 側につけます。"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "refdes": "L1",
      "kind": "Inductor",
      "value": "100u DCR=0.05",
      "pos": [
        56,
